WhatsCanvas always provides the CPU-only software renderer:

    find_package(WhatsCanvas CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS Software)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE WhatsCanvas::Software)

The OpenGL target requires the opengl feature:

    vcpkg install whatscanvas[opengl]
    find_package(WhatsCanvas CONFIG REQUIRED COMPONENTS OpenGL)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE WhatsCanvas::OpenGL)

The text feature selects opengl and adds FreeType and HarfBuzz support.
The application owns the OpenGL context; create the canvas only after the
context is current.
